{
  "$comment": [
    "Every downloaded asset in the game, declared in one place.",
    "All models and textures are CC0 photoscans from Poly Haven (polyhaven.com).",
    "",
    "'tris' is the triangle budget after simplification. Poly Haven ships raw scan",
    "density -- some of these are millions of triangles and hundreds of megabytes",
    "of vertex data -- so the budget is what actually decides the size of the game.",
    "Numbers are chosen by how close you get to the thing: a tree you walk under",
    "earns more than a pebble you step over.",
    "",
    "'res' is the texture resolution to fetch. 1k is plenty for anything scattered",
    "in bulk; the ground you stare at all day gets 2k."
  ],

